  "steps": [
    "For the cashew paste, soak dates, almonds, cashews in some warm milk for 20-30 mins and blend into a very smooth paste with a pinch of salt.",
    "In a pan, add 350 ml milk and let it simmer for 3-4 mins.",
    "To the milk, add cocoa powder, cinnamon and the date paste. Mix well until there are no clumps.",
    "Now add the dark chocolate and mix until the mixture is velvety smooth and gets thick. In 3-4 mins your dark chocolate should be ready!",
    "Enjoy as is or top it with some whipped cream/marshmallows.",
